   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "The noun according to the number",
     "texto": [
      "With numbers ending in **1**, except **11**, the singular nominative usually follows (**21 процент**); with numbers ending in **2, 3, 4**, except **12–14**, the singular genitive follows (**23 процента**); in all other cases, the plural genitive (**25 процентов**, **111 процентов**). Look at the last two digits."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numerals also decline",
     "texto": [
      "с двумя участниками (with two participants), к трём городам (to three cities), около пяти процентов (about five per cent). In compound numbers, check which case the construction requires."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Dates and years",
     "texto": [
      "The date is said with an ordinal in the genitive and the month in the genitive: пятого мая. The year: в две тысячи двадцать пятом году (in 2025). On forms you also write 5 мая 2025 года."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
